{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"075a7fa4ae709b43343e7d11eb78d8d1356b54666974e0bb76bfd72dfe2a89a4","ja":"私も、ちょっとボーッとしちゃって……。\n貴音さんがいてくれて、本当に良かったです！","zh":"我也稍微有点心不在焉了……\n有贵音小姐在，真是太好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9d70ff3c05b93e14958917b762b33c4fb5534c5e306f814171649b86b73f6f5a","ja":"情けは……人のため、ならず……。","zh":"施惠于人……实为利己……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d7c9c6572dae3056b3b668809d3af3ff4fd9fea029629204a5c00ccd8e114a17","ja":"それ、使い方合ってるの？　まあ、とにかく、\n貴音のおかげで、トークショーも成功ね♪","zh":"那个用法对吗？不过不管怎样，\n多亏了贵音，脱口秀也很成功呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"db91803f252335c6ee503ac6548d6c2670f9dee68455547123d603efaf372cd7","ja":"ねぇ、この後は貴音の好きなものでも食べに……\nって、さすがに遅くなっちゃうかしら？","zh":"呐，待会儿要不要去吃点贵音喜欢的东西……\n不过，那样是不是就太晚了呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bd6e850d61d1e97d31ed50ada653aea7bd26b6f70feedf76cda40206db36ddfe","ja":"らぁめんの上にマシマシ……。\nまだ、盛っても良いのですか……？","zh":"在拉面上加大份量……\n还可以继续往上加吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"07878da7b8de82716a956d000e84500d91565ff208c075149360961835f4ca45","ja":"……ちょっと貴音？\nさっきから会話が噛み合ってないわよ……ん？","zh":"……我说贵音？\n从刚才开始就完全没对上话啊……嗯？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"90b866f39f11083aab3ece128d3ee6b8c4b1609b2d4bdd9bc84c68f2bfaec253","ja":"……ここはやはり、替え玉、を……すぅ……。","zh":"……这里果然还是要，再来一份替玉……呼……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c6855ec74c75ef0761d070ca546bfa5404f9b3cd95201097b2abd63db62a7ec2","ja":"もしかして……四条さん、寝ちゃってる？","zh":"难道说……四条小姐睡着了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ed68deabc97f0271aa217975f5ff242a516744197443cbe8ce3c391f4997c929","ja":"じゃあ今までのって、寝言なのかな？","zh":"那刚才那些，难道是梦话吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"5dc0f77dd785ff13931d16646db525e9c9a1624b96d25637b70852f3334b2a94","ja":"四条さんも疲れてたんだね。\nイベントが無事に終わって、ホッとしたのかな～。","zh":"四条小姐也累了呢。\n活动顺利结束，总算松了口气吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1489.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"3d3ad1989af1f5c55c19187b8eb437fe37c0deefda746454e7252ced13c0ca0e","ja":"そうかも。今日は頑張ってくれてたし、\nこのままちょっと、寝かせてあげよっか。","zh":"也许是吧。今天这么努力，\n就让她先稍微睡会儿吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
